[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13922.87, "timestamp": "03:52:02", "text": "一端，对吧？为什么我们不能？就像你一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13924.75, "timestamp": "03:52:04", "text": "大多数时候都像单身一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13927.75, "timestamp": "03:52:07", "text": "合作。如果你也参加 Jockathon 活动，我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13929.11, "timestamp": "03:52:09", "text": "可以像小组合作一样与……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13931.83, "timestamp": "03:52:11", "text": "每个人。是的，小组合作将会是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13934.71, "timestamp": "03:52:14", "text": "很好，但会很混乱，而且……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13937.67, "timestamp": "03:52:17", "text": "这将是有趣的部分。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13941.11, "timestamp": "03:52:21", "text": "有趣的部分。是的，这将是全新的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13942.87, "timestamp": "03:52:22", "text": "对你来说，目标就像一个新的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13946.309, "timestamp": "03:52:26", "text": "待完成的任务。我该如何才能做到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13948.229, "timestamp": "03:52:28", "text": "很多人参与合作并制作它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13952.07, "timestamp": "03:52:32", "text": "工作？是的，我的意思是，我本来应该……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13957.67, "timestamp": "03:52:37", "text": "但是我现在还不能这么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13960.55, "timestamp": "03:52:40", "text": "正确的？是的，那会和你一起等着。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13962.469, "timestamp": "03:52:42", "text": "你过去这几周一直是这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13965.83, "timestamp": "03:52:45", "text": "数周没有精力。哦，是的，我没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13969.11, "timestamp": "03:52:49", "text": "你觉得你能应付得了。对，就是那个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13973.71, "timestamp": "03:52:53", "text": "这也是个因素。嗯，是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13976.87, "timestamp": "03:52:56", "text": "我意识到，群体更难"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13979.67, "timestamp": "03:52:59", "text": "也能做到。你必须照顾好"}]